---
import AboutHeroImage from '../assets/images/getting-silver.jpeg';
import Layout from '../layouts/BlogPost.astro';

import rainbows from '../assets/images/rainbows.jpeg';
import senior from '../assets/images/SB.jpg';

import ISE from '../assets/images/ISE.jpeg';

import croagh from '../assets/images/croagh-patrick.jpg'

const leftImages = [
	{alt:"Me and my classmates in a human pyramid", image:{src: ISE.src, width: ISE.width, height: ISE.height, format: ISE.format}},
	{alt:"Me and my sister as rainbows", image:{src: rainbows.src, width: rainbows.width, height: rainbows.height, format: rainbows.format}}
]

const rightImages = [
	{alt: "Me and some friends doing badges in the dark", image: {src: senior.src, width: senior.width, height: senior.height, format: senior.format}},
	{alt: "Me and some friends on the top of Croagh Patrick", image: {src: croagh.src, width:croagh.width, height:croagh.height, format: croagh.format}}
]
---

<Layout
	title="About Me"
	description="About me"
	pubDate={new Date('October 02 2026')}
	heroImage={AboutHeroImage}
	leftImages={leftImages}
	rightImages={rightImages}
>
	<p>
		I am an 18-year-old university student.
		I'm studying Immersive Software Engineering at UL.
		I'm in my first year.
	</p>

	<p>
		<b>Guides</b> <br/>
		I've been a Girl Guide since I was six, starting in Wales and continuing in Ireland.
		I'm now a Senior Brancher and am training to be a leader. <br/>
	</p>

	<p>
		<b>Bronze & Silver Gaisces</b> <br/>
		I achieved my bronze gaisce in 2024.
		For bronze, I volunteered with my church, walked, and did coding. I then hiked 25km on Achill Island. <br/> <br/>

		I achieved my silver gaisce in 2025.
		For silver, I volunteered with a local ladybird unit, swam, and wrote. I then hiked 50km of the East Clare Way. <br/>
	</p>

	<p>
		<b>Other Hobbies</b> <br/>
		I also like writing and reading.
		I was a member of my secondary school debate and robotics teams, as well as the creative writing club.
	</p>
</Layout>
